Maintainer: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wildos-fluent-icons
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Fluent icon theme, yellow, for Wild OS
 The Fluent icon theme by vinceliuice, built from its source at commit
 c8a244f571ef8fb47812bdc9dbce76546cedce69 with the yellow folder colour:
 Fluent-yellow, Fluent-yellow-light and Fluent-yellow-dark. The Wild OS
 icon themes are drawn on top of it and take their folders, This computer
 and the Recycle Bin from it.
